controls-numpad = Numpad 1–9 moves in eight directions; 5 waits. NumLock may be on or off. Press X to look, G to pick up, O then a direction to open, C then a direction to close, F to aim, and < or > to use stairs; Esc cancels an interaction mode.
controls-vi = HJKL moves orthogonally, YUBN moves diagonally, and period waits. Press X to look, G to pick up, O then a direction to open, C then a direction to close, F to aim, and < or > to use stairs; Esc cancels an interaction mode.
controls-wasd = WASD moves orthogonally, QEZC moves diagonally, and Space waits. Press X to look, G to pick up, O then a direction to open, C then a direction to close, F to aim, and < or > to use stairs; Esc cancels an interaction mode.
